  "steps": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat. Add the onion and carrot with a pinch of salt, and cook for 6 to 8 minutes until softened.",
    "Stir in the garlic, cumin, ground coriander, paprika, turmeric, cinnamon and chilli powder. Cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the tomato paste and cook for 1 minute, stirring so it darkens slightly.",
    "Pour in the canned tomatoes and water, then add the red lentils. Bring to a boil, reduce to a gentle simmer and cook for 15 to 18 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the lentils are soft.",
    "Stir in the chickpeas, salt and black pepper. Simmer for 5 more minutes until the soup is thick and the chickpeas are hot.",
    "Remove from the heat and stir in the lemon juice and chopped coriander. Taste and adjust seasoning before serving hot."
